WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Before accepting an office fit out quote in Newcastle, check more than the total at the bottom.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Here are five questions for a business to take to its appointed project team.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
First, has everyone priced the same scope and drawing revision?

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
Different starting information can produce prices that are difficult to compare.

00:21.000 --> 00:31.000
Second, what is included, excluded or still an allowance?

00:31.000 --> 00:35.000
Give each missing item an owner and keep unpriced work visible.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Third, is this the construction price or the whole project budget?

00:44.000 --> 00:50.000
Furniture, IT, professional fees, moving costs and contingency may sit elsewhere.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
Keep the GST basis consistent and do not count the same allowance twice.

01:00.000 --> 01:03.000
Fourth, what does the program depend on?

01:03.000 --> 01:14.000
Ask about access, landlord works, approvals, procurement and the decisions needed from the business.

01:15.000 --> 01:18.000
Fifth, how will changes and handover be handled?

01:18.000 --> 01:23.000
Confirm the review and instruction process, completion information and outstanding actions.

01:29.000 --> 01:33.000
Have the relevant contract and legal advisors review the terms before commitment.

01:33.000 --> 01:38.000
Your Office Space can help coordinate that comparison from the client side under an agreed scope.

01:38.000 --> 01:41.000
It does not act as the builder or head contractor.

01:41.000 --> 01:47.000
Find the free Newcastle fitout Guides and checklists at yourofficespace.au/office-fitout.

01:47.000 --> 01:50.000
Then talk to the team about the questions in your project.

